    "title": "Cancer survivor receives second chance at life with triple transplant - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dina Bair Katharin Czink ,\n1 days ago CHICAGO – When cancer attacks, the fight to survive is top of mind. And while treatments do a good job of getting rid of the initial disease, they can ravage the body in ways that leave permanent damage. Now doctors at Northwestern are giving a young woman a new chance at life after two cancers and dozens of treatments left her in need of a triple transplant. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
